---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700">
      <p>NomadMatrix ("we", "our", or "us") values your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines our practices regarding data collection and protection when you access our website.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We do not require users to create an account to view our free visa database. We may collect anonymous analytical data (such as page views, browser type, and country of origin) to improve content accessibility.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">2. Third-Party Services & Links</h2>
      <p>When you purchase digital products via Gumroad or click outbound links (including official embassy portals or SafetyWing), your interaction is subject to their respective privacy terms. We do not store or process your credit card numbers on our servers.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">3. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We may use minimal local storage or cookies strictly necessary for performance and security through our CDN providers.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our contact channels.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
